{
  "about": "Every request this app sends, or has a viewer's browser send, to an address the owner did not enter. One entry per row of About's \"What leaves your network\" list (apps/ui/src/lib/utils/outbound-requests.ts), with the backend modules that make it and the hosts it reaches. backend/tests/pure/test_outbound_registry.py holds the backend to it: a module that can send a request, or a new outside host, has to be listed here; the SPA's tests hold the About list to the same keys. Adding an entry means adding its row and its wording in every locale.",
